# Extra files the source distribution must carry.
#
# NOTICE.md ships as a License-File and points readers at docs/sources.md for
# the Nordic references it relies on, so docs/ has to travel with it or the
# distributed legal text dangles. THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md is the dependency
# license audit that docs/releasing.md reconciles at every tag, and examples/
# is what CI runs as its simulated smoke test — both belong next to the code
# they describe.
include CHANGELOG.md
include CONTRIBUTING.md
include INSTALL.md
include NOTICE.md
include ROADMAP.md
include SECURITY.md
include THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md
graft docs
graft examples
graft tests
